      }), " (popularized by Netflix's Hystrix, now mostly implemented through Resilience4j, Polly, or service mesh sidecar proxies) become necessary. A circuit breaker monitors failure rates to a downstream dependency and, when failures exceed a threshold, \"opens\" the circuit, failing fast rather than queuing requests against an unavailable service. This prevents cascading failures and gives the downstream service time to recover."]
