      children: "Microservices shift operational complexity significantly. With a monolith, you have one process to deploy, one log stream to watch, and one runtime to instrument. With dozens or hundreds of services, the operational surface area expands dramatically. Teams that adopt microservices without investing in the corresponding infrastructure tooling typically find themselves spending more time on operations than on features."
